<h2 id="visuals">Diagrams</h2><p>Architecture visuals use web-native and source-controlled diagram formats. Mermaid is the primary choice for Markdown diagrams, with HTML/CSS/SVG for interactive presentation and Node.js tooling for diagram generation, validation and documentation workflows. Other supported formats can be used where they fit the architecture: D2, Markmap, Ilograph, Excalidraw and Cytoscape.js.</p><a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/NotY215/NotYVOS/tree/main/docs/diagrams" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open diagram sources ↗</a>
